<article class="env-lemma" id="04SH">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04SH">Lemma <span data-tag="04SH">65.16.4</span>.</a> Let $\mathit{Sch}_{fppf}$ be a big fppf site. Let $S \to S'$ be a morphism of this site. Let $F'$ be a sheaf on $(\mathit{Sch}/S')_{fppf}$. The following are equivalent: </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
The restriction $F'|_{(\mathit{Sch}/S)_{fppf}}$ is an algebraic space over $S$, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
the sheaf $h_ S \times F'$ is an algebraic space over $S'$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The restriction and the product match under the equivalence of categories of Sites, Lemma <a href="/tag/00Y1" data-tag="00Y1">7.25.4</a> so that Lemma <a href="/tag/04SG" data-tag="04SG">65.16.3</a> above gives the result. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>